Registered Users
To provide You with the benefit of Services for registered Users only;
To provide Property Alerts to You (which You have set up) for properties marketed on Our Platforms that meet Your search criteria;
To provide Tracked Property Alerts to You (which You have set up) for properties You are tracking, their valuation
and pricing trends in the local area;
To provide You access to alerts and options for mortgages, re-mortgages and to allow You to asses and review Your affordability when looking for a property;
